{"sha": "9ad0a65a6ab96da5061293512a59e04bc69ece81c78cddbbe46df89d2137d1bf", "body": ["{\\small $u_{n+1} = \\sqrt{u_n + 2}$，$u_0 = 0$ 的阶梯作图", "（\\cref{exo:g12:seq:6}）：每一竖直步在曲线上读出 $f(u_n)$，", "每一水平步借助 $y = x$ 将其折回横轴，数列", "逐步升至不动点 $\\ell = 2$，即曲线与直线的交点。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g12:seq:sqrt2}", "设 $u_0 = 2$，$u_{n+1} = \\frac{1}{2}\\left(u_n + \\frac{2}{u_n}\\right)$。", "用归纳法易证 $u_n \\geq \\sqrt{2}$ 对所有 $n$ 成立（不等式", "$\\frac{1}{2}(x + 2/x) \\geq \\sqrt{2}$（$x>0$）等价于", "$(x - \\sqrt2)^2 \\geq 0$），再证 $(u_n)$ 递减，因为", "\\[", "u_{n+1}-u_n=\\frac{2-u_n^2}{2u_n}\\leq 0 .", "\\]", "递减且有下界，$(u_n)$", "收敛于某个 $\\ell \\geq \\sqrt{2}$，该极限必满足", "$\\ell = \\frac{1}{2}(\\ell + 2/\\ell)$，即 $\\ell^2 = 2$。于是", "$u_n \\to \\sqrt{2}$。这就是海伦算法，", "早已为巴比伦人所用；其收敛极快（$u_3$ 已给出 $\\sqrt 2$", "精确到小数点后八位的近似值）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:seq:1}", "用归纳法证明：对所有 $n \\in \\N$，", "\\[", "1^2 + 2^2 + \\dots + n^2 = \\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6}.", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:seq:2}", "研究下列由 $n \\geq 1$ 定义的数列的单调性：", "\\[", "a_n = \\frac{n+1}{n}, \\qquad", "b_n = \\frac{2^n}{n}, \\qquad", "c_n = n^2 - 10n .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:seq:3}", "求下列数列的极限，其通项分别为", "\\[", "u_n = \\frac{3n^2 - n + 1}{2n^2 + 5}, \\qquad", "v_n = \\sqrt{n+1} - \\sqrt{n}, \\qquad", "w_n = \\frac{2^n - 3^n}{3^n + 1}.", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:seq:4}", "设 $(u_n)$ 为等差数列，$u_0 = 5$，公差", "为 $r = 3$，$(v_n)$ 为等比数列，$v_0 = 8$，公比", "为 $q = \\frac{1}{2}$。求 $u_n$、$v_n$、$\\sum_{k=0}^{n} u_k$ 与", "$\\sum_{k=0}^{n} v_k$，并求这四个式子当", "$n \\to +\\infty$ 时的极限。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:seq:5}", "利用夹逼定理，求", "\\[", "\\lim_{n\\to+\\infty} \\frac{n + \\cos n}{n + 1}", "\\qquad\\text{ 与 }\\qquad", "\\lim_{n\\to+\\infty} \\frac{n!}{n^n},", "\\]", "其中 $n! = 1 \\times 2 \\times \\dots \\times n$。对第二个极限，", "试用等比数列的某一项对 $\\frac{n!}{n^n}$ 作上界估计。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:seq:6}", "设 $u_0 = 0$，$u_{n+1} = \\sqrt{u_n + 2}$，对所有 $n \\in \\N$。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 用归纳法证明 $0 \\leq u_n \\leq 2$，对所有 $n$ 成立。", "  \\item 证明 $(u_n)$ 递增。", "  \\item 由此推出 $(u_n)$ 收敛，并求其极限。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:seq:7}", "一位病人每天早上服用 $1$ 个单位的药物。在每", "个 24 小时内，人体会排出体内现存药量的 $40\\%$。设 $u_n$ 为", "第 $n$ 天刚服药后体内的药量，且满足", "$u_0 = 1$。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 说明 $u_{n+1} = 0.6\\,u_n + 1$。", "  \\item 设 $v_n = u_n - 2.5$。证明 $(v_n)$ 为等比数列，并由此推出", "        $u_n$ 的通项公式。", "  \\item 求体内药量的长期稳定值。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:seq:8}", "设数列 $(u_n)$ 由 $u_0 = 3$ 与 $u_{n+1} = \\frac{4u_n - 1}{u_n + 2}$ 定义。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 用归纳法证明 $u_n > 1$ 对所有 $n \\in \\N$ 成立。", "  \\item 证明 $v_n = \\dfrac{1}{u_n - 1}$ 确定一个等差数列。", "  \\item 由此求 $v_n$ 与 $u_n$ 的通项公式，以及", "        $(u_n)$ 的极限。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:seq:9}", "对 $n \\geq 1$，令", "$H_n = 1 + \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} + \\dots + \\frac{1}{n}$.", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 证明：对所有 $n \\geq 1$，$H_{2n} - H_n \\geq \\frac{1}{2}$。", "  \\item 由此推出 $H_{2^k} \\geq 1 + \\frac{k}{2}$ 对所有 $k \\in \\N$ 成立，并", "        得出 $H_n \\to +\\infty$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}